1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,735
Most app icons are a letter on a square.

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:05,823
A sleeping cat for a focus timer.

3
00:00:05,863 --> 00:00:08,030
A hooded hero for a story game.

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,800
You draw the SVG, or your coding agent does,

5
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:15,815
with IconFlow's playbook.

6
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:19,786
Compare finalists side by side, at real size.

7
00:00:20,823 --> 00:00:23,059
Pass review, and one SVG ships

8
00:00:23,099 --> 00:00:26,510
as favicon, app icon, desktop and menu bar.

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,724
Free, open source, on your machine.

10
00:00:29,764 --> 00:00:31,156
And the icon is yours.

11
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,259
IconFlow.

12
00:00:40,299 --> 00:00:42,435
Still itself at sixteen pixels.
